      "declared_speaker": "Robert",
      "source_time": "2026-09-25T14:40:00Z",
      "text": "Where should recovery live: its own page, or inside the work detail?",
      "sha256": "2b30728e0738f92ec274c3b364fa3bc9f0f644965e29f4ead9a3d0438d61daf2"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "declared_speaker": "Codex",
      "source_time": "2026-09-25T14:41:00Z",
      "text": "A separate Recovery page keeps an exception visible even when nobody opens the detail.",
      "sha256": "1189bc39197b4403c323a7f621f616c8f23eaf4380459b89e29e228b0e974923"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "declared_speaker": "Claude Code",
      "source_time": "2026-09-25T14:42:00Z",
      "text": "Recovery is a state of the attempt. Inside Work detail it sits next to the evidence and the next safe action.",
      "sha256": "086800c1a7d9d48c34dc5d2ca76ed726f0eb09f5ea0a77e883efd4a1a872a412"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "declared_speaker": "Codex",
      "source_time": "2026-09-25T14:43:00Z",
      "text": "Then the overview must list open exceptions first, or they will be missed.",
      "sha256": "0de09a4432cec6be89484466cbb6b448de811f3a3ee5ecacae12961b1cae1560"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "declared_speaker": "Robert",
      "source_time": "2026-09-25T14:44:00Z",
      "text": "Agreed that the overview surfaces them. I will record the placement decision separately.",
      "sha256": "b3c06e342c21f7a0cda98e9953eeed2671d821e64a2e0b8bcd254e7c4d298ca3"
    }
